
# basePath Chapter4

::FirstContractOpenCh4 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 
//change this to dorian. 
{@PAL}      	Wow, what a thrilling game of laser-tag! 
{@Dorian}    	Thanks P.A.L.. 
{@Player}     	Oh, don't get ahead of yourself. I'm still way ahead of you.
{@Dorian}     	Sure, sure. 
{@Player}    	Plus you are a desk man now, right?  
{@Dorian}    	Hey!!! 
{@Player}	    I'm joking! Mostly...
{@Dorian}   	Ok, ok. I've got to head out. That was fun. 
{@Dorian} 		See you soon!

::BeforeSupplyChainCh4
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

//incoming call
{@Blaze}    	Hi Locke! 
{@Blaze}    	Just a heads up that our copper production has shut-down for the next few cycles.
{@Player}		Those bots giving you trouble again?
{@Blaze}    	We're taking time to celebrate the Kalvis Festival! You should stop by.
{@Player}		Well, I'm not sure how Mara would feel about that. 
{@Blaze}		What you are talking about? We would love to see you.
{@Blaze}    	Anyway, all the materials are available but they might be a little slower. I've updated new times so the Supply Chain Console will show the new delivery schedule. 
{@Player}   	Thanks for letting me know but I'm in a bit of a crunch right now. 
{@Blaze}		Sure thing! See you later. 
//phone hangs up

{@PAL}      	Kalvis tends to be... unrealiable with their... "holidays.”
{@Player}		Sounds fun though...

//introduce callie and extra boron

//quinn will introduce the idea that the hauling region you need is larger. She wants you to connect to callie to make sure she's willing to deal with you since you are frontier now. 

{@Quinn}	I heard you needed more boron.   
{@Quinn}	And, I might have the perfect contact for you...its cheaper, but you know. A little more risky. 
{@Quinn} 	I'm going to patch you through to Callie. 
{@Quinn} 	By the way, make sure not to offend her. 
//call callie

{@Callie}   A'hoy! I see a Frontier call sign... how scandalous. 
{@Callie}   Be blessed in my presence mere corpo-lackey! Or as I like to call ye, Clackey!
{@Callie}  	It is I, the Boron Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station! 
{@Player}  	Nice to meet you... Callie. 
{@Callie}   Since the great revolt of the Velos Penal Station...
{@Callie}   ...all Frontier ships are marked for pillaging!
{@Callie}   However, if you do continued business with us... 
{@Callie}   We may... avert our attention elsewhere. 
{@Player}   That sounds risky!
{@Callie}   Risk, schmisk, sometimes a little  adventure is the only way to feel alive! 
{@Callie}   Holler if you need some goods, Clackey. 
{@Player}  	Don't call me that- aaaand she hung up. 

::AfterSupplyChainCh4 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@trigger
@once 

